== Walkthrough ==

''[[Runethar Hamest]] is located at -150, -520 in the Temple of Thunder ([[Cleric]] and [[Paladin]]) Guild Hall.''

You say, 'Hail, Runethar Hamest'

: Runethar Hamest says, 'Welcome to the Temple of Thunder. We are home to paladins and clerics who follow the ways of Karana. Do you [need guidance] or are you [already a follower of Karana]?'

'''Hand [[Runethar Hamest]] [[a tattered note]]'''

:: ''a tattered note reads:''

:: <code>Harness the power of the storm, become one with Thunder. Join the Knights of Thunder in raining Karana's will across the lands of Norrath. Give this note to Guild Master Runethar Hamest at the Temple of Thunder, south of the Grounds of Fate and to the east of the Qeynos docks.</code>

: Runethar Hamest says, 'Thank you Teddee, and welcome to the Temple of Thunder. Wear this tunic with pride as you walk through these lands, and protect the flock of Karana wherever your foot may fall. Go and see [[Gehna Solbenya]], I'm sure she will have Temple duties for you to complete.'

